      <li>Semaglutide: PubChem <a href="https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/56843331" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CID 56843331</a>; EMA <a href="https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/ozempic" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Ozempic EPAR</a>.</li>
      <li>Tirzepatide: PubChem <a href="https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/166567236" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CID 166567236</a>; EMA <a href="https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/mounjaro" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Mounjaro EPAR</a>.</li>
