    </ul>
    <p class="small muted">Reference molecular data; the batch COA governs the material supplied. No efficacy claim is made.</p>

    <h2>Limitations</h2>
    <p>Molecular and analytical information only; no dosing, efficacy or human-use guidance. The batch COA governs the material supplied.</p>

